# h03 -- a reader's own slot converts to DDL's lock.
#
# T1 reads the table, its IS in a slot, then alters it: its X
# sweeps T1's own slot into the lock table and converts it. T2's
# IS then waits for T1, as for any X, until T1 commits.


== pairing RR/RR == T1=RR T2=RR
@1 T1 begin -> ok
@1 T2 begin -> ok
@2 T1 lockoid 1 is -> ok
@3 T1 lockoid 1 exclusive -> ok
@4 T2 lockoid 1 is blocks -> blocked
@5 T1 commit -> ok
@4 T2 lockoid 1 is blocks -> ok (resumed)
@6 check last T2 ok -> satisfied
@7 T2 commit -> ok
@8 check committed T1 T2 -> satisfied
